channel 3 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of the bass. AUDCTL 28 joins channels 3 and 4 into one 16-bit
  note  counter on the 1.79 MHz clock, and this channel's own volume is never heard.

channel 4 notes BASS
  note  Cellos and basses an octave down, on the 16-bit table: E galloping under the tune,
  note  a C# pedal under the full orchestra's answer, a pizzicato scale climbing under the
  note  violins' figure, and the stringendo's chromatic bass - every note within a cent.
  voice BASS
  track HOLD  @BASS_HOLD B1 . . .  . . . .
  track HOFF  . . - .  . . . .
  track PICK  . . . .  . . E2 E2
  track EG    E2 . E2 E2  E2 . E2 E2
  track EQ    E2 . E2 .  E2 . E2 E2
  track BQ    B1 . B1 .  B1 . E2 E2
  track BG    B1 . B1 B1  B1 . B1 B1
  track EEE   E2 . E2 .  E2 . - .
  track TC    @BASS_FF C#2 . - .  C#2 . - .
  track TCG   @BASS_FF C#2 . - .  G#2 . G#1 .
  track TCCC  @BASS_FF C#2 . C#2 .  C#2 . - .
  track TCF   @BASS_FF C#2 . - .  F#2 . F#1 .
  track TBBB  @BASS_FF B1 . B1 .  B1 . - .
  track TLAND @BASS_FF B1 . - .  . . . .
  track LUP1  - . B1 .  C#2 . D#2 .
  track LUP2  E2 . F#2 .  G#2 . A2 .
  track LUP3  B2 . B1 .  B2 . - .
  track LDOWN B2 . - .  - . E2 E2
  track ME8   @BASS_FF E2 . E2 .  E2 . E2 .
  track ME    @BASS_FF E2 . - .  E2 . - .
  track MD    @BASS_FF D#2 . - .  D#2 . - .
